Package: phoneblock-dongle
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: PhoneBlock Linux SIP spam-call blocker
 Native Linux service that registers as a SIP endpoint, checks callers
 against PhoneBlock, and streams a G.711 A-law announcement for spam calls.